{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52884","headline":"谒圣容 · 浑惟明","name":"谒圣容","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法雨震天雷，祁山一半颓。\n鳞鳞碧玉色，寂寂现如来。\n缧髻从烟合，圆光满月开。\n从兹一顶谒，永劫去尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"浑惟明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}